ext": "The postal parcels, what a wonder,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Like Christmas in the sun, I\u2019ll not sunder."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Treasures that make me smile with cheer,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "The joy in my eyes is crystal clear."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}